This is my corner store. Decent prices on everything, especially for the area. Good day after drinking greasy breakfast. Great catfish po' boy and daily lunch specials! They close early and will not take a card for purchases under $10. The cashier is comically unfriendly and wears a latex glove on her money taking hand."},{"business_id":"xjuNVMzPPqEYbRN_hFtecA","review_id":"Z4Dq7RSNp3ujoEMlrFV-mg","date":"2011-12-29T04:03:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.872523307800293,"text_excerpt":"Continuing my look back on New Orleans deli's I find myself here at Toulouse House, and how could I not. You've been one of my go-to's in the quarter for sometime now. You will know me by what I order every time. Turkey on french, baby! That was the first and the last thing that you've made for me. Why switch it up when you find something that works, right? I'm sure their other food must be good as well, but their simple turkey on french (hot or cold, with or without bacon) is just tasty. Fresh bread, lettuce, tomatos, pickles, plus mayo. Seems hard to screw up, but some do. Not Toulouse House. Only downside is that the kitchen closes über early at 4pm.."},{"business_id":"xjuNVMzPPqEYbRN_hFtecA","review_id":"qqO9otAErHC1mxg_zRgsWg","date":"2017-03-19T20:55:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8646569848060608,"text_excerpt":"It is exactly what it should be, convenient. And it had pretty good po boys and breakfast sandwiches. I ask them to add turkey breakfast meat but the staff said no. It has small store that sells hot food, all beverages, and household items."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xjuNVMzPPqEYbRN_hFtecA","photo_id":"k2q9lY3l7Cg-q2bKcfsPEA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/k2q9lY3l7Cg-q2bKcfsPEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
